# Searching for the Right Words (jeuno 66): the mustZone the Vigil's reward sets. Rubbish Day and Never to Return
# completed, fame level 6, the Vigil accepted with the Holy Candle, and Prog 1 set by a GM (as if Kurou-Morou's 17 were
# done) so that Ilumida shows the offer: 194 completes the Vigil (mustZone set); Ilumida then has no section (189);
# after a zone change she offers 197 (option 1: begun, Prog 3).
lists UpperJeuno/Ilumida/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/194 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/197
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-73.5,-1.2,57.3 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.ACandlelightVigil accepted
quest Jeuno.RubbishDay completed
quest Jeuno.NeverToReturn completed
fame Sandoria 284
fame Bastok 283
fame Windurst 283
keyitem HolyCandle
charvar Quest[3][66]Prog 1
login
trigger Ilumida                         # the Vigil's 194
finish                                  # the Vigil completed; Searching for the Right Words' mustZone
trigger Ilumida                         # mustZone: no section; default 189
finish
rezone                                  # the zone change clears mustZone
trigger Ilumida                         # Prog 1: 197
finish option=1                         # begun, Prog 3
